+/*
+ * LinuxOnTab: eventfd. libuv (Node's event loop) creates its async wakeup fd
+ * with eventfd() on Linux and has no pipe fallback there, so uv_loop_init()
+ * failed without it. The host kernel is Linux too: pass it straight through.
